R337	Addressee Arg1:T324 Arg2:T328	
T329	Quotation 153438 153605	"There is a place they call La Pature, on the top of the hill, on the edge of the forest. Sometimes, on Sundays, I go and stay there with a book, watching the sunset."
R338	Addressee Arg1:T324 Arg2:T329	
R339	Speaker Arg1:T326 Arg2:T329	
R340	Cueing Arg1:T327 Arg2:T329	
T330	Quotation 153606 153657	"I think there is nothing so admirable as sunsets,"
