T332	Cue 153662 153669	resumed
T333	Quotation 153671 153711	"but especially by the side of the sea."
T334	Quotation 153712 153734	"Oh, I adore the sea!"
T335	Cue 153735 153739	said
R341	Addressee Arg1:T326 Arg2:T333	
R342	Addressee Arg1:T326 Arg2:T330	
R343	Cueing Arg1:T332 Arg2:T333	
