T354	Quotation 154770 154948	"That's sheer modesty. Why, my dear fellow, the other day in your room you were singing 'L'Ange Gardien' ravishingly. I heard you from the laboratory. You gave it like an actor."
R371	Cueing Arg1:T352 Arg2:T354	
