T1058	Quotation 245081 245102	"She is very pretty,"
T1059	Entity 245103 245105	he
T1060	Cue 245106 245110	said
T1061	Quotation 245123 245311	"she is very pretty, this doctor's wife. Fine teeth, black eyes, a dainty foot, a figure like a Parisienne's. Where the devil does she come from? Wherever did that fat fellow pick her up?"
T1062	Entity 245114 245121	himself
T1063	Quotation 245565 246054	"I think he is very stupid. She is tired of him, no doubt. He has dirty nails, and hasn't shaved for three days. While he is trotting after his patients, she sits there botching socks. And she gets bored! She would like to live in town and dance polkas every evening. Poor little woman! She is gaping after love like a carp after water on a kitchen-table. With three words of gallantry she'd adore one, I'm sure of it. She'd be tender, charming. Yes; but how to get rid of her afterwards?"
R1143	Addressee Arg1:T1062 Arg2:T1061	
R1144	Cueing Arg1:T1060 Arg2:T1061	
R1145	Speaker Arg1:T1059 Arg2:T1061	
