T1064	Quotation 246758 246780	"Oh, I will have her,"
T1065	Entity 246781 246783	he
T1066	Cue 246784 246789	cried
R1150	Speaker Arg1:T1065 Arg2:T1064	
R1151	Cueing Arg1:T1066 Arg2:T1064	
