T1069	Entity 246929 246936	himself
T1070	Quotation 246939 247138	"Where shall we meet? By what means? We shall always be having the brat on our hands, and the servant, the neighbours, and husband, all sorts of worries. Pshaw! one would lose too much time over it."
T1071	Entity 247144 247146	he
T1072	Cue 247147 247154	resumed
T1073	Quotation 247156 247262	"She really has eyes that pierce one's heart like a gimlet. And that pale complexion! I adore pale women!"
T1074	Quotation 247333 247538	"It's only finding the opportunities. Well, I will call in now and then. I'll send them venison, poultry; I'll have myself bled, if need be. We shall become friends; I'll invite them to my place. By Jove!"
T1075	Cue 247539 247544	added
T1076	Entity 247545 247547	he
T1077	Quotation 247549 247672	"there's the agricultural show coming on. She'll be there. I shall see her. We'll begin boldly, for that's the surest way."
