T1228	Cue 262333 262358	went on as if speaking to
T1229	Quotation 262369 262607	"Yes, I have missed so many things. Always alone! Ah! if I had some aim in life, if I had met some love, if I had found someone! Oh, how I would have spent all the energy of which I am capable, surmounted everything, overcome everything!"
