T1262	Quotation 266460 266470	"I think,"
T1263	Cue 266471 266475	said
T1264	Entity 266476 266493	Monsieur Lheureux
T1265	Entity 266497 266508	the chemist
T1266	Quotation 266540 266685	"that they ought to have put up two Venetian masts with something rather severe and rich for ornaments; it would have been a very pretty effect."
T1267	Quotation 266686 266699	"To be sure,"
T1268	Cue 266700 266707	replied
T1269	Entity 266708 266714	Homais
T1270	Quotation 266716 266899	"but what can you expect? The mayor took everything on his own shoulders. He hasn't much taste. Poor Tuvache! and he is even completely destitute of what is called the genius of art."
T1271	Entity 267528 267530	he
R1366	Cueing Arg1:T1263 Arg2:T1266	
R1367	Speaker Arg1:T1264 Arg2:T1266	
R1368	Addressee Arg1:T1265 Arg2:T1266	
