T2048	Entity 361830 361833	She
T2049	Cue 361834 361843	stammered
T2050	Quotation 361845 361903	She is an insolent, giddy-headed thing, or perhaps worse!"
T2051	Entity 362054 362057	she
T2052	Cue 362058 362073	ended by saying
T2053	Quotation 362076 362104	"Very well! I'll go to her."
T2054	Quotation 362208 362228	"Excuse me, madame."
T2055	Entity 362197 362200	she
T2056	Cue 362201 362205	said
T2057	Quotation 363043 363058	"Do take care!"
T2058	Entity 363059 363061	he
T2059	Cue 363062 363066	said
T2060	Quotation 363068 363086	"Ah! if you knew!"
T2061	Entity 363087 363090	she
T2062	Cue 363091 363098	replied
T2063	Quotation 363268 363325	"Come, my poor angel, courage! Be comforted! be patient!"
T2064	Quotation 363326 363496	"But I have been patient; I have suffered for four years. A love like ours ought to show itself in the face of heaven. They torture me! I can bear it no longer! Save me!"
T2065	Quotation 363666 363698	"What is, it? What do you wish?"
T2066	Entity 363640 363642	he
T2067	Cue 363661 363665	said
T2068	Quotation 363699 363714	"Take me away,"
T2069	Quotation 363726 363757	"carry me off! Oh, I pray you!"
T2070	Entity 363715 363718	she
T2071	Cue 363719 363724	cried
T2072	Quotation 363869 363878	"But -- "
T2073	Entity 363879 363887	Rodolphe
T2074	Cue 363888 363895	resumed
T2075	Quotation 363897 363904	"What?"
T2076	Quotation 363905 363924	"Your little girl!"
T2077	Cue 363959 363966	replied
T2078	Entity 363925 363928	She
T2079	Quotation 363969 364008	"We will take her! It can't be helped!"
T2080	Quotation 364009 364024	"What a woman!"
T2081	Entity 364025 364027	he
T2082	Cue 364028 364032	said
T2083	Entity 364036 364043	himself
T2084	Entity 364706 364709	She
T2085	Entity 364719 364722	his
T2086	Cue 364732 364741	murmuring
T2087	Quotation 364744 365005	"Ah! when we are in the mail-coach! Do you think about it? Can it be? It seems to me that the moment I feel the carriage start, it will be as if we were rising in a balloon, as if we were setting out for the clouds. Do you know that I count the hours? And you?"
T2089	Cue 369698 369706	had said
T2090	Entity 369710 369713	him
T2091	Quotation 369716 369775	"I want a cloak -- a large lined cloak with a deep collar."
T2092	Quotation 369776 369805	"You are going on a journey?"
T2093	Entity 369806 369808	he
T2094	Cue 369809 369814	asked
T2095	Quotation 369816 369883	"No; but-- never mind. I may count on you, may I not, and quickly?"
T2096	Quotation 369894 369918	"Besides, I shall want,"
T2097	Entity 369919 369922	she
T2098	Cue 369923 369930	went on
T2099	Quotation 369932 369966	"a trunk-- not too heavy-- handy."
T2100	Quotation 369967 370064	"Yes, yes, I understand. About three feet by a foot and a half, as they are being made just now."
T2101	Quotation 370065 370088	"And a travelling bag."
T2102	Quotation 370145 370151	"And,"
T2103	Cue 370152 370156	said
T2104	Entity 370157 370170	Madame Bovary
T2105	Quotation 370204 370248	"take this; you can pay yourself out of it."
T2106	Quotation 370501 370559	"You will leave everything at your place. As to the cloak"
T2107	Quotation 370592 370691	"do not bring it either; you can give me the maker's address, and tell him to have it ready for me.
T2108	Quotation 371744 371766	"Everything is ready?"
T2109	Entity 371767 371770	she
T2110	Cue 371771 371776	asked
T2111	Entity 371777 371780	him
T2112	Quotation 371782 371788	"Yes."
T2113	Quotation 371895 371909	"You are sad,"
T2114	Cue 371910 371914	said
T2115	Entity 371915 371919	Emma
T2116	Quotation 371921 371931	"No; why?"
T2117	Quotation 371988 372023	"It is because you are going away?"
T2118	Entity 372024 372027	she
T2119	Cue 372028 372035	went on
T2120	Quotation 372037 372250	"because you are leaving what is dear to you-- your life? Ah! I understand. I have nothing in the world! you are all to me; so shall I be to you. I will be your people, your country; I will tend, I will love you!"
T2121	Quotation 372251 372271	"How sweet you are!"
T2122	Entity 372272 372274	he
T2123	Cue 372275 372279	said
T2124	Quotation 372306 372315	"Really!"
T2125	Entity 372316 372319	she
T2126	Cue 372320 372324	said
T2127	Quotation 372350 372382	"Do you love me? Swear it then!"
T2128	Quotation 372383 372432	"Do I love you-- love you? I adore you, my love."
T2129	Quotation 373740 373766	"Ah! what a lovely night!"
T2130	Cue 373767 373771	said
T2131	Entity 373772 373780	Rodolphe
T2132	Quotation 373782 373805	"We shall have others,"
T2133	Cue 373806 373813	replied
T2134	Entity 373814 373818	Emma
T2135	Cue 373820 373850	and, as if speaking to herself
T2136	Quotation 373852 374069	"Yet, it will be good to travel. And yet, why should my heart be so heavy? Is it dread of the unknown? The effect of habits left? Or rather -- ? No; it is the excess of happiness. How weak I am, am I not? Forgive me!"
T2137	Quotation 374070 374092	"There is still time!"
T2138	Entity 374093 374095	he
T2139	Cue 374096 374101	cried
T2140	Quotation 374103 374137	"Reflect! perhaps you may repent!"
T2141	Quotation 374138 374146	"Never!"
T2142	Entity 374147 374150	she
T2143	Cue 374151 374156	cried
T2144	Quotation 374196 374531	"What ill could come to me? There is no desert, no precipice, no ocean I would not traverse with you. The longer we live together the more it will be like an embrace, every day closer, more heart to heart. There will be nothing to trouble us, no cares, no obstacle. We shall be alone, all to ourselves eternally. Oh, speak! Answer me!"
T2145	Quotation 374566 374581	"Yes-- Yes -- "
T2146	Quotation 374706 374763	"Rodolphe! Rodolphe! Ah! Rodolphe! dear little Rodolphe!"
T2147	Quotation 374781 374792	"Midnight!"
T2148	Cue 374793 374797	said
T2149	Entity 374798 374801	she
T2150	Quotation 374803 374841	"Come, it is to-morrow. One day more!"
T2151	Quotation 374967 374992	"You have the passports?"
T2152	Quotation 374993 374999	"Yes."
T2153	Quotation 375000 375029	"You are forgetting nothing?"
T2154	Quotation 375030 375035	"No."
T2155	Quotation 375036 375051	"Are you sure?"
T2156	Quotation 375052 375064	"Certainly."
T2157	Quotation 375065 375146	"It is at the Hotel de Provence, is it not, that you will wait for me at midday?"
T2158	Quotation 375158 375180	"Till to-morrow then!"
T2159	Cue 375181 375185	said
T2160	Entity 375186 375190	Emma
T2161	Quotation 375334 375346	"To-morrow!"
T2162	Entity 375347 375350	she
T2163	Cue 375351 375356	cried
T2164	Quotation 375662 375686	"What an imbecile I am!"
T2165	Entity 375687 375689	he
T2166	Quotation 375716 375755	"No matter! She was a pretty mistress!"
T2167	Quotation 375899 375916	"For, after all,"
T2168	Entity 375917 375919	he
T2169	Cue 375920 375929	exclaimed
T2170	Quotation 375946 375996	"I can't exile myself-- have a child on my hands."
T2171	Quotation 376050 376155	"And besides, the worry, the expense! Ah! no, no, no, no! a thousand times no! That would be too stupid."
